# GTA 6 Clipper (free, Stage 1)

Setup (your own PC, needs Python 3.10+ and ffmpeg):
    pip install yt-dlp faster-whisper
Run on any YouTube/Twitch/Kick link you have permission to clip:
    python -m clipper.cli run "https://youtube.com/watch?v=..." --streamer CreatorName --top 8
Output: clips/CreatorName_01.mp4 ... + clips/manifest.json (titles, timestamps). Upload the clips by hand
to TikTok / Shorts / Reels / X. Tests: python -m pytest tests
See PLAN.md and the staged roadmap (prove it earns first, automate later).
